515	Both lanes render the same feed record, open the same article slug, preserve the same title and author, and navigate through the same registration surface.
516	
517	## Direct Witness interaction
518	
519	Every click, type, key press, hover, and wheel action is issued through the directly linked Witness implementation. Playwright supplies the low-level browser host, but it does not replace or synthesize the selected user interactions.
