616	 * inner panels instead has no scrollable document to gesture at, and inventing
617	 * one would be a false claim. So the same generic measurement that backs a
618	 * scroll claim is taken at every visited route and recorded here instead:
619	 * `scrollHeight` never exceeds `clientHeight`, which is why no scroll coverage
620	 * is claimed. Routes are recorded individually rather than summarized, so a
621	 * route that starts overflowing later cannot hide inside a total.
622	 */
